<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">2YW - Bible Iyansi</book>
  <para style="h">2 YWAN</para>
  <para style="toc1">Un'kaan wàyweel wà Ywan</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 YWAN</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Yw</para>
  <para style="mt2">Un'kaan wàyweel wà</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ywan</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbɔr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1"/>Mɛ undweer, an'söön Un'kaar kàsɔ̈ɔ̈l Nzam anà baan ande abà in'kwen mɛ u pɛɛlà a ndandaa. Kà ntɔn mɛ mpɛl anki, wɛɛ sye akà baar banswà abye anà ngyööb a ndandaa, <verse eid="2JN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2"/>ntɔn ndandaa ayà uboo a bi, anà isàkal ipepey anà bi.<verse eid="2JN 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3"/>Kab a ngway, ngyɛb anà duu amà man'fà akà Taa Nzam, anà akà Yɛsu Klistɔ, Mwan a Taa, màyàkal anà bi ntɔn bi ikäl anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ unsà ndandaa anà ukwen. <verse eid="2JN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4"/>Mɛ kàmɛn un'sak mbɔɔn muman baan angye bumwɛy: mɔ̈ɔ̈ aba ban'pà u mbwo a ndandaa, asànaa nswɛɛŋ kàwɛl bi akà Taa. <verse eid="2JN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5"/>Apà, Un'kaar, mɛ amàlɔm apanà, mɛ kà nswɛɛŋ akün kàlasöön anki, wɛɛ ya akwà awà bi ayà fà nsɛmà: wɛy bi ikwen bi a bi. <verse eid="2JN 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6"/>Ler naa ukwen bà nkye: naa bi ipe mɔ̈ɔ̈ abi u mbwo a nswɛɛŋ ande. Asànaa nswɛɛŋ làwem bɛ fà nsɛmà, ntɔn bɛ làläb mbwo ayin. <verse eid="2JN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7"/>Ntɔn abwiiy mbɔɔn bàkyàpää u mɛɛn: ba làkwikilà bàfàsà anki u ngyeel a Yɛsu Klistɔ unsà imbuur. Yà unsà yayin waa bàyöb un'bwiiy anà un'yiiŋ a Klistɔ. <verse eid="2JN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8"/>Làkäl kà igyɛɛŋ bɛ ŋakwo, ntɔn bweel a isal abi bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n akyà bwà, wɛɛ bɛ làwɛl bweel aŋàkwo.<verse eid="2JN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9"/>Mbuur wanswà mpa awà uboo a an'lɔɔŋ a Klistɔ, wɛɛ akwen ukyà kwɛl, nde un'tüüb watɛy ana Nzam. Mbuur awà uboo a an'lɔɔŋ amà, wàŋàtüüb anà Taa anà Mwan. <verse eid="2JN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10"/>Isàkal naa mbuur an'yà akà bɛ, anà kàlatwääl anki an'lɔɔŋ amà, twon lun'wɛl, twon lun'pɛ mbɔr sye. <verse eid="2JN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11"/>Ntɔn mbuur awun'pà mbɔr, nde an'bulà un'yööb ande unsà isal ande byà ibe.<verse eid="2JN 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nswaal a ndeer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12"/>Mɛ in'yàfàkal anà indiir mbɔɔn mukalasöön, wɛɛ mɛ inkwen anki musɔn unsà làkay a un'kaan anà tin. Ntɔn mbalà yumwɛy mɛ in'yà akà bɛ anà mutɛn unsà ndaa a duu, abun un'sak abi asàkal wàŋàkwo.<verse eid="2JN 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13"/>Mbɔr yi yan'fà akà baan a mpääŋ angye wàŋàsɔɔl.<verse eid="2JN 1:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1"/>
</usx>
